 "headline": "Pramukh Swami Maharaj receives diksha",
 "story": "Shantilal receives parshad diksha in Ahmedabad and becomes Shanti Bhagat. After renouncing Chansad on 7 November 1939, Shantilal met Shastriji Maharaj in Ahmedabad on 21 November 1939. Shastriji Maharaj blessed Shantilal and expressed his wish, “In the morning, I want to initiate you as a parshad.”",
